description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-03-31T19:01:05Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T15:13:10Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproduceable in 4.4.1,  stable mono (Also 4.3 without the tool button)\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 Intel 14th gen processor\n\n### Issue description\n\n3D Raycasting from a point inside an object doesn't detect a hit, even with hit_from_inside = true.\n\nTested with gdscript and C#, godot physics and Jolt.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSet up a raycast from inside an object with hit_from_inside = true in the ray query parameters.\n\nIn the MRP:\n\nSee the raycast not detecting a hit from the inside\n- Move the MeshInstance3D node (with static body child) to the origin\n- Press the Test tool button on the MeshInstance3D\n- See \"No intersection found\" in the output\n\nSee the same raycast successfully detecting a hit from outside.\n- Move the MeshInstance3D to (0, 1, 0)\n- Press the Test tool button\n- See that an intersection is detected at (0, 0.5, 0) \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[hit_from_inside_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19540020/hit_from_inside_test.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104858/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104858/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}